*  DAY_driver - exercises DAY(DATE): the day of the week for a date given as
*  M/D/Y.  Contract per DAY.sno header (real arithmetic, DATE()-shaped input).
*  Every case passes an EXPLICIT year so DATE() is never consulted and the
*  driver stays deterministic.
-INCLUDE "DAY.sno"
        OUTPUT  =  DAY('7/4/1976')
        OUTPUT  =  DAY('1/1/2000')
        OUTPUT  =  DAY('2/29/2000')
        OUTPUT  =  DAY('12/25/1999')
        OUTPUT  =  DAY('3/1/1900')
        OUTPUT  =  DAY('8/20/2026')
END
